# Real spellings that the digests in tests/test_publishable.py must catch.
#
# Copy this file to `forbidden_samples.txt` and put the real ones in it. That
# file is gitignored, like `forbidden_words.txt` and for the same reason: the
# guard keeps the names as digests so that the repository does not spell them
# out, and a readable sample in a committed file would undo that.
#
# One sample per line, each a spelling the guard must flag: a name spaced,
# hyphenated or glued, a mail domain, a prefix used as a class prefix, inside a
# version tag or as a path segment. A leading "!" marks one it must NOT flag,
# such as a short prefix read as a unit of time after a number. Blank lines and
# "#" comments are ignored.
#
# These stand-ins show the shape; they are not what the real digests hold.
Globex
Glo-bex
mail ops@globex.example
GlxFoo::bar
preGLX12
platform/glx/Selector.cpp
!24 glx
